\v 12 \add ≈If you¦85620 pay attention to these¦85623 instructions and always obey¦85625 them¦85626\add*, then¦85627 your¦85629 god¦85629 Yahweh¦85628 will¦85627 keep¦85627 the¦85633 agreement that¦85637 he¦85638 promised¦85638 to¦85639 your¦85639 ancestors¦85639 and \add continue to display his\add* loyal¦85636 commitment¦85636 to you,\x + \xo 7:12-16: \xt Deu 11:13-17.\x*
