\v 12 Then¦86517 \add *he¦86518\add* told¦86517 me¦86519, ‘\add ≈Now hurry and\add* go¦86521 down¦86521 quickly¦86522 from¦86523 here¦86523, because¦86524 your¦86526 people¦86526 who you¦86528 brought¦86528 out¦86528 from¦86529 Egypt¦86529, have¦86525 become corrupted¦86525. They¦86530 \add ^didn't take at all long\add* \add ≈to turn¦86530 away from¦86532 following my instructions¦86536\add*—they've¦86537 \add already\add* made¦86537 a¦86539 metal¦86539 \add idol\add* for themselves.’
