\v 11 \add ^There'll always be poor people in your country\add*,\x + \xo 15:11: \xt Mat 26:11; Mrk 14:7; Yhn 12:8.\x* so¦89597 I¦89598 command¦89599 you¦89599 to¦89600 give generously¦89601 to the poor¦89607 and¦89608 needy¦89608 and your¦89609 fellow Israelis.
\s1 Freeing slaves
