\v 12 If¦89612 a \add ≈fellow Israeli\add* is sold¦89614 to¦89615 you\f + \fr 15:12 \ft Often to pay off their debt.\f* and¦89620 serves¦89620 you¦89620 for six¦89621 years¦89622, then¦89623 you¦89625 must¦89625 free¦89626 them in¦89623 the¦89624 seventh¦89624 year¦89623.\x + \xo 15:12-18: \xt Lev 25:39-46.\x*
