\p
\v 16 \add ≈However,\add* if¦89673 any slave says¦89675 that they don't¦89677 want to¦89676 leave¦89678 you¦89679, because¦89680 they \add ≈appreciate\add* you¦89681 and¦89682 your¦89684 household¦89684, and so they're better¦89687 off to¦89688 stay with¦89689 you¦89689,
