\v 2 In any of the towns that your god Yahweh¦90234 is¦90236 giving¦90236 you, if¦90226 you discover¦90228 any man¦90238 or¦90239 woman¦90241 who¦90242 does¦90243 evil¦90246 by¦90251 disobeying the agreement¦90252 that \add *he's\add* made with you
\v 3 and \add ≈worshipped¦90255\add* other¦90257 gods¦90256, or the sun¦90260, moon¦90263, or¦90264 stars—all¦90265 of¦90267 which¦90269 I've¦90272 prohibited you from doing,\x + \xo 17:3: \xt Exo 22:20.\x*
\v 4 and¦90274 it's¦90274 reported¦90274 to¦90276 you, and¦90277 you¦90277 listen¦90277 and¦90278 investigate¦90278 it thoroughly¦90279, and¦90280 it's¦90284 true that this¦90286 \add ≈detestable¦90285\add* thing was¦90284 done¦90284 in¦90287 Yisrael¦90287,
