\v 6 \add Note that\add* that person can only be executed if there's at least two¦90324 witnesses \add as evidence\add*—no one can be put to death on¦90333 the¦90335 testimony of¦90335 just one witness¦90336.\x + \xo 17:6: \xt Num 35:30; Deu 19:15; Mat 18:16; 2Cor 13:1; 1Tim 5:19; Heb 10:28.\x*
