\v 8 If¦90356 a¦90361 case¦90376 is¦90357 too¦90357 difficult¦90357 for¦90358 you¦90358 yourselves to \add ≈judge¦90362\add* \add ≈(e.g., two parties claiming bloodshed, or lawsuits, or assaults, or other disputes within your¦90377 towns)\add*, you¦90378 must¦90378 leave town and¦90379 go¦90379 to¦90380 the¦90382 place¦90382 that¦90383 your¦90386 god¦90386 Yahweh¦90385 is going to choose¦90384.
