\p
\v 14 When you¦90495 enter the¦90498 land¦90498 that¦90499 your¦90501 god¦90501 Yahweh¦90500 is¦90502 about¦90502 to¦90502 give¦90502 you¦90503, then¦90504 occupy¦90504 and¦90505 live¦90505 in¦90506 it¦90506, and¦90507 you¦90507 say¦90507 that you need a¦90510 king¦90510 over¦90509 you like¦90511 all¦90511 the¦90513 surrounding¦90515 countries have,\x + \xo 17:14: \xt 1Sam 8:5.\x*
\v 15 you¦90518 can appoint¦90518 the king over you that Yahweh¦90523 chooses¦90522. Your¦90527 king¦90530 must¦90532 be¦90532 \add ≈an Israeli\add*—\add ≈never allow a¦90535 foreigner¦90536 to become your¦90540 king\add*.
\v 16 However, he¦90546 mustn't acquire a large number of horses for himself, and¦90550 he¦90552 should never send people¦90555 to¦90556 Egypt¦90556 to¦90558 buy horses¦90559,\x + \xo 17:16: \xt 1Ki 10:28; 2Ch 1:16; 9:28.\x* because Yahweh¦90560 has¦90561 told¦90561 you all to¦90565 never go back that¦90567 way¦90566 again¦90568.
\v 17 He¦90571 mustn't \add ≈take a lot of wives¦90574 for himself\add* \add ≈or else he might stop\add* \add worshipping Yahweh\add*.\x + \xo 17:17: \xt 1Ki 11:1-8.\x* Nor should he \add ≈accumulate too much\add* gold¦90579 and silver¦90578.\x + \xo 17:17: \xt 1Ki 10:14-22,27; 2Ch 1:15; 9:27.\x*
\p
\v 18 Once he's¦90587 sitting¦90587 on¦90588 his \add ≈royal\add* throne¦90589, he¦90591 must¦90591 copy¦90595 for himself the¦90596 instructions¦90596 on the scroll¦90600 \add ≈that's in the custody of\add* the Levitical priests¦90602,
\v 19 then¦90605 he must keep it¦90605 with¦90606 him¦90606 and¦90607 read¦90607 \add some of\add* it¦90608 every¦90609 day¦90611 so¦90613 that¦90613 he¦90614 learns¦90614 to¦90615 honour¦90615 his¦90619 god¦90619 Yahweh¦90618—being careful to¦90620 follow all¦90623 the instructions¦90626 and¦90628 regulations¦90630 written in it
\v 20 so that he won't¦90634 \add ≈think he's more¦90638 valued than¦90638 his¦90638 fellow citizens\add*, and¦90639 so¦90646 that¦90646 he doesn't \add ≈ignore those instructions¦90643 even slightly\add*. \add ≈As a result, him and¦90645 his¦90651 descendants¦90653 will rule as kings in¦90654 Yisrael¦90655 for many years\add*.
\c 18
