\p
\v 1 None of the¦90662 Levites¦90662 (including the¦90665 priests¦90661) will receive \add any land as\add* an¦90668 inheritance¦90668 like the \add ≈other Israelis¦90671\add*. \add ≈Instead, the¦90672 people's offerings¦90672 to Yahweh¦90673 will be their inheritance to sustain them\add*.
