\p
\v 3 This¦90694 is¦90695 the¦90696 requirement that the¦90699 people¦90699 do for the¦90702 priests¦90697: whenever they bring a bull¦90705 or¦90706 a sheep¦90708 as a sacrifice, they must give¦90709 the¦90711 shoulder¦90711, the¦90712 cheeks¦90712, and¦90713 the¦90713 stomach¦90713 to the priest¦90710.
