\v 5 because¦90726 your¦90730 god¦90730 Yahweh¦90729 chose¦90728 them out of¦90730 all¦90731 your¦90733 tribes¦90733 for them and¦90740 their descendants¦90740 permanently to¦90735 serve¦90735 \add *him¦90738\add*.
