\v 6 If a Levite¦90749 chooses to move \add his family\add* from¦90750 their town in any part of Yisrael¦90754 and¦90760 sincerely wants¦90763 to go to the¦90767 place¦90767 that¦90768 Yahweh¦90771 will¦90770 choose¦90770,
\v 7 then¦90773 he¦90773 can join the¦90780 other Levites¦90780 there¦90782 to¦90783 serve¦90773 his¦90776 god¦90776 Yahweh¦90784
