\p
\v 9 When you¦90797 enter the¦90801 land¦90801 that¦90802 your¦90805 god¦90805 Yahweh¦90804 is¦90806 about¦90806 to¦90806 give¦90806 you¦90807, don't¦90808 \add ≈imitate the¦90812 disgusting habits\add* of¦90812 those¦90814 peoples.
\v 10 There mustn't be¦90818 anyone among you¦90819 who¦90820 passes¦90820 their son¦90821 or daughter¦90823 through fire¦90824, or who¦90825 uses divination¦90826 or omens \add to try to tell the future\add*,\x + \xo 18:10: \xt Lev 19:26.\x* or who¦90828 practices¦90828 sorcery¦90829,\x + \xo 18:10: \xt Exo 22:18.\x*
