\v 12 because¦90841 anyone¦90847 who¦90847 does¦90847 those¦90848 \add >things\add* is abhorrent to Yahweh. It's because of¦90849 those¦90851 kinds of¦90853 things that your¦90853 god¦90853 Yahweh will drive¦90854 \add @those¦90855 other¦90855 peoples¦90855\add* \add ≈away ahead¦90856 of¦90856 you¦90856\add*.
