\v 14 because¦90865 the¦90868 groups that¦90869 you'll¦90870 \add ≈expel from the land¦90867\add* \add ≈rely on\add* fortune-tellers and¦90876 diviners¦90878, but¦90880 your¦90889 god¦90889 Yahweh¦90888 won't¦90881 allow¦90883 you to¦90887 do that.
\s1 Yahweh promises to send prophets
