\p
\v 15 Your¦90898 god¦90898 Yahweh¦90897 will \add ≈select a¦90891 man¦90893 from¦90892 among¦90892 you and send him as\add* a prophet¦90891 like¦90894 me¦90894. You must¦90895 \add ≈take notice of\add* him¦90899,\x + \xo 18:15: \xt Acts 3:22; 7:37.\x*
