\v 7 You¦92422 may take¦92429 the¦92425 \add ≈eggs or the¦92428 baby birds\add*, but you¦92429 must¦92429 \add ≈allow the mother¦92425 bird to¦92431 fly away\add*. Do that so¦92432 that¦92432 things will go¦92433 well¦92433 for¦92434 you¦92434 and¦92435 so that you'll¦92435 live \add in the land\add* for a long¦92435 time¦92436.
\p
\v 8 When you¦92440 build¦92440 a¦92441 new¦92442 house, be sure to include a¦92444 railing around your \add flat\add* roof¦92445, so¦92446 you¦92448 won't¦92446 \add ≈be guilty of¦92450 having caused someone's death\add* if¦92451 a person falls¦92454 off it¦92455 \add and dies\add*.
