\p
\v 12 \add Twist threads together to\add* make¦92492 tassels¦92491 and \add sew them\add* onto the¦92497 four¦92497 corners¦92498 of¦92498 your¦92499 cloak.\x + \xo 22:12: \xt Num 15:37-41.\x*
\s1 Rules about marriage and rape
