\p
\v 13 If¦92506 a¦92509 man¦92509 takes¦92508 a¦92510 wife¦92510 and¦92511 \add ≈sleeps with\add* her¦92512, then¦92513 hates¦92513 her¦92513
\v 14 and¦92515 accuses her¦92516 of¦92517 shameful things, \add ≈destroying her reputation¦92521\add* and¦92523 \add ≈claiming that¦92527 she hadn't been\add* a virgin¦92535,
\v 15 then¦92537 the¦92539 young¦92539 woman's¦92539 parents¦92541 must show the evidence of¦92541 her¦92541 virginity¦92545\f + \fr 22:15 \ft Presumably, the blood-stained sheet.\f* to¦92548 the¦92550 elders¦92550 at the¦92551 city¦92551 gate¦92552.
