\v 17 and¦92573 made¦92576 shameful accusations about¦92577 her not¦92580 being a virgin¦92584. Then¦92585 the¦92586 parents must¦92588 spread¦92588 out¦92588 that cloth¦92589 and show it to¦92590 the¦92592 city¦92592 elders¦92591.
\v 18 Then¦92594 the¦92596 city¦92596 elders¦92595 must¦92602 punish¦92602 that¦92598 man¦92601
\v 19 and¦92605 fine¦92605 him¦92606 a¦92607 hundred¦92607 silver¦92608 \add coins\add* to be paid¦92609 to¦92610 the¦92611 young¦92611 woman's¦92611 father¦92610 for¦92612 defaming an Israeli¦92618 virgin¦92617. Then¦92619 she'll¦92621 remain as his wife¦92622 and he'll¦92625 be¦92625 prohibited from \add ever\add* \add ≈divorcing\add* her¦92626.
