\v 22 If¦92677 a¦92680 man¦92680 is¦92679 discovered¦92679 sleeping with¦92683 another man's wife¦92685, then¦92689 both¦92692 of¦92692 them¦92692 must \add ≈be executed\add*. That's¦92694 how you'll¦92699 remove¦92699 evil¦92700 from¦92701 Yisrael¦92701.
