\v 23 If¦92704 a¦92706 young¦92706 woman¦92706 is¦92705 engaged¦92709 to¦92710 a¦92710 man¦92710, and¦92711 \add another\add* man¦92712 sleeps¦92714 with¦92715 her¦92715,
