\v 28 If¦92823 a¦92826 man¦92826 \add ≈overpowers\add* a¦92827 young¦92827 woman¦92827 who's¦92830 not¦92831 engaged¦92833, and¦92834 \add ≈rapes\add* her¦92834, and¦92835 it's¦92836 discovered¦92837,\x + \xo 22:28-29: \xt Exo 22:16-17.\x*
\v 29 that¦92853 man¦92840 must pay her¦92842 father¦92843 fifty¦92846 silver¦92847 coins, and¦92848 she'll¦92850 become his wife¦92851 because¦92852 he's¦92854 violated¦92854 her¦92854. He'll¦92857 then be¦92857 prohibited from \add ever\add* \add ≈divorcing\add* her¦92858.
\p
\v 30 A¦92871 man¦92871 must¦92870 never \add ≈sleep with\add* any of¦92874 his¦92875 father's¦92875 \add #wives¦92874\add* \add ?≈because that would¦92877 expose¦92877 his¦92879 father's¦92879 nakedness\add*.\x + \xo 22:30: \xt Lev 18:8; 20:11; Deu 27:20.\x*
