\p
\v 3 No Ammonite¦92917 or Moabite is allowed to enter into¦92919 Yahweh's¦92920 assembly, even down past the tenth¦92923 generation¦92922\x + \xo 23:3-5: \xt Neh 13:1-2.\x*
\v 4 since they¦92941 wouldn't \add even sell\add* you¦92942 bread¦92943 and¦92944 water¦92944 when¦92946 the people were travelling from¦92947 Egypt¦92947 \add to Canaan\add*. \add ≈What's more,\add* they hired¦92949 Beor's¦92956 son¦92954 Bil'am \add !(Balaam)\add* (from¦92957 Petor¦92957 in Aram¦92958-Naharayim¦92959) to¦92960 curse¦92960 you¦92960
\v 5 \add ≈However,\add* your god Yahweh¦92966 \add ≈took no notice of¦92967\add* Bil'am and¦92972 turned¦92972 the¦92978 curse¦92978 into¦92979 a blessing¦92979 because¦92980 \add *he\add* loves¦92981 you¦92981,\x + \xo 23:5: \xt Num 23:7–24:9.\x*
