\v 7 \add In contrast,\add* don't¦92998 despise the Edomites¦93001 because¦93002 they're your¦93003 \add ≈cousins\add* \add (descendants of your ancestor Yitshak)\add*. And don't¦93006 despise the Egyptians, because¦93010 you¦93013 \add ≈lived there\add* as foreigners.
\v 8 The third¦93023 generation¦93022 \add !(grandchildren)\add* of any of \add @Edomites or Egyptians\add* that live among you, may enter Yahweh's¦93027 assembly¦93026.
