\v 15 You¦93141 mustn't \add ≈return\add* any \add #slaves¦93142\add* to¦93143 their master¦93145 if they escaped and got to¦93149 you¦93149.
\v 16 \add ≈Allow¦93155 them to stay¦93155\add* \add ≈in your town\add* and don't¦93165 mistreat¦93166 them.
