\v 17 \add ≈Don't¦93170 allow any¦93174 Israeli¦93175 man or woman to become a¦93179 religious\add*\f + \fr 23:17 \ft Or, cultic.\f* prostitute¦93179.\x + \xo 23:17: \xt Lev 19:29.\x*
\v 18 \add ≈Don't¦93185 allow anyone woman or man to bring¦93187 any¦93195 part of¦93188 their¦93204 wages\add* as a¦93189 \add secular\add* prostitute¦93189 into your god Yahweh's temple¦93192, because¦93198 both¦93204 \add @female¦93204 and¦93204 male¦93204 prostitution¦93204\add* is abhorrent to \add *him\add*.
\p
\v 19 You¦93209 mustn't charge¦93209 interest¦93209 to¦93210 your¦93210 fellow Israeli, whether it's money¦93212 or food¦93214 or anything else \add ≈that's¦93219 borrowed\add*.\x + \xo 23:19-20: \xt Exo 22:25; Lev 25:36-37; Deu 15:7-11.\x*
