\v 21 When you¦93250 make a¦93251 vow¦93251 to¦93252 your god Yahweh¦93252, don't¦93254 put off fulfilling it¦93256, because¦93257 \add *he\add* will \add ≈hold you¦93263 accountable\add* and¦93264 \add not doing it\add* would \add count as\add* \add ≈disobeying him\add*.
