\v 24 If¦93294 you're¦93295 walking¦93295 through \add ≈someone else's\add* vineyard¦93296, you¦93298 can eat¦93298 as many grapes¦93299 as \add ≈you like\add*, but you mustn't pick any to¦93300 \add take away\add* in¦93302 a container¦93304.
