\v 1 When a¦93328 man¦93328 marries¦93330 a¦93329 woman¦93329, then¦93330 \add ≈further on he decides he doesn't want her¦93330 because of something he¦93341 found¦93341 out about\add* her¦93342, then¦93345 he¦93345 must¦93345 write¦93345 a¦93347 divorce¦93348 notice and¦93349 give¦93349 it¦93349 to her¦93350, and¦93351 send¦93351 her¦93351 out of¦93352 his¦93352 house¦93352.\x + \xo 24:1: \xt Mat 5:31; 19:7; Mrk 10:4.\x*
