\v 4 then the first husband¦93387 isn't allow to¦93393 take¦93393 her¦93393 back as his wife¦93396. \add That's\add* because¦93396 she's¦93399 been¦93399 defiled¦93399 and it¦93403 would be abhorrent to¦93404 Yahweh¦93405, and¦93406 you¦93407 mustn't defile the¦93410 land¦93410 that¦93411 your¦93413 god¦93413 Yahweh¦93412 is¦93414 giving¦93414 you.
\rem /s1 Miscellaneous Laws; Various Laws
