\v 5 When a man¦93422 \add ≈is newly married\add*, he mustn't \add ≈be called for\add* the army¦93427 \add ≈or be given any¦93432 other responsibilities\add*. He¦93436 must¦93436 be¦93436 free¦93435 for one¦93439 year¦93438 \add ≈to¦93437 establish his house¦93437\add* and¦93440 \add ≈to satisfy his¦93443 new¦93424\add* wife¦93443.
