\v 7 If¦93461 someone¦93464 is¦93463 found¦93463 to have abducted a¦93466 fellow Israeli¦93469 to make them into a¦93470 slave¦93470 or to sell¦93473 them, then¦93474 that¦93476 abductor must¦93477 \add ≈be executed\add* in order to purge¦93477 such evils¦93478 from¦93479 \add ≈your¦93479 country\add*.\x + \xo 24:7: \xt Exo 21:16.\x*
