\v 8 Stay on guard¦93481 against a \add ≈deadly skin¦93484 disease¦93484\add*. Always follow what the¦93493 priests¦93493 and Levites¦93494 tell you all¦93488 to do, as¦93495 I've¦93496 instructed¦93496 them¦93496.\x + \xo 24:8: \xt Lev 13:1–14:54.\x*
