\v 12 \add ≈However,\add* if¦93544 \add ≈that person¦93546\add* is poor¦93547 \add and gives clothing or a blanket as security\add*, don't¦93549 \add ≈keep it overnight\add*.
\v 13 Take it back to them when the¦93560 sun¦93560 goes¦93559 down so they'll \add be warm\add* when they sleep¦93561. Then¦93563 they'll bless¦93563 you¦93563 and¦93564 your¦93569 god¦93569 Yahweh¦93568 \add ≈will be pleased with\add* you.
