\v 14 Don't¦93572 oppress¦93574 any poor¦93576 or needy¦93577 hired¦93575 workers, whether they're fellow Israelis or¦93579 foreigners who¦93581 live in your towns.\x + \xo 24:14-15: \xt Lev 19:13.\x*
\v 15 At the end of each day¦93585, pay¦93586 them before sunset, because¦93593 they need it to live on. Then¦93602 they won't¦93602 cry¦93604 out¦93604 to¦93606 Yahweh¦93608 against you and¦93609 have him \add ≈hold you¦93610 accountable\add*.
