\v 16 Parents¦93617 mustn't be¦93616 executed¦93616 for what their children¦93620 have done, and¦93621 children¦93621 mustn't be¦93624 executed¦93624 for what their parents have done. Any person must¦93633 only be¦93633 executed¦93633 for what they themselves have done.\x + \xo 24:16: \xt 2Ki 14:6; 2Ch 25:4; Eze 18:20.\x*
