\v 21 \add Similarly,\add* when¦93709 you¦93702 \add ≈pick your grapes¦93702\add* in the vineyard¦93703, don't¦93704 \add ≈go back over the vines a second time\add*. Those will¦93705 be for the foreigner¦93707, or the orphan or widow¦93709.
\v 22 \add ^Don't forget\add* that you were a¦93715 slave¦93715 in¦93717 Egypt¦93718—that's why I'm¦93722 instructing you¦93723 to do¦93724 those \add #things¦93727\add*.
\c 25
