\v 5 If¦93790 some brothers¦93793 live¦93792 \add ≈on the same property\add* and¦93795 one¦93796 of them¦93797 dies¦93795 without leaving¦93812 a¦93798 son¦93798, then the widow mustn't marry outside¦93808 \add ≈of the family\add*. Her¦93811 brother-in-law must¦93814 take¦93814 her¦93814 as a¦93816 wife¦93816 for himself and¦93817 \add ≈perform¦93817 the duty of\add* a¦93817 brother-in-law.\x + \xo 25:5-6: \xt Mat 22:24; Mrk 12:19; Luk 20:28.\x*
